==Strategy==
Cadaver Bear is fought like Ursamajor with attacks almost as fast as [[Assassin Bear]]'s. It hits hard and quickly but can be countered easily with [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser]] spam if there isn't too much support on the field.

Cadaver Bear will move fast and burrow past your front line so save a couple of attackers to take him out afterwards ([[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] are preferred). The faster Cadaver Bear dies, the more likely it is that you can finish the level before Metal Hippoe catches up. The Metal Hippoe will be annoying and tank for Cadaver Bear if you don't kill the bear fast enough.

Just play safe, spam lots of meatshields and try to work down Cadaver Bear before Metal Hippoe becomes a problem.

In Chapter 3, the only notable addition is Li'l Zyclone, who is only spawned once. In that case, the [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blast]] Cannon cancels out Li'l Zyclone's main purpose, which is cutting off your supply lines.

